plete!","sub":[]}],"guide_pics":[{"sec":"New Varrock","p":[["qimg/ff3281ee6d3b.webp","",151,200,"npc"]]}],"image":["qimg/9288176f3837.webp","Dimension of Disaster",480,256],"start_pics":[["qimg/6284d11c3a52.webp","Start: Aris",257,600],["qimg/3a61471b063c.webp","Start area: Varrock",480,270]],"start_steps":{"start_here":{"pic":["locimg/sh_f191029315399b25.webp","Aris — Misthalin",0,0,"start"],"coords":[3203,3424],"entrance_name":"Aris"},"start_overview":["locimg/ov_ee485912cbe378c3.webp","Aris — Misthalin",0,0,"map"],"get_inside":[{"text":"Misthalin","pic":null},{"text":"Varrock east entrance","pic":["locimg/a20e1d4f062ef863.webp","Varrock east entrance",0,0]},{"text":"Varrock lodestone is located by the south gate.","pic":null},{"text":"Varrock Teleport or the teletab teleports to the main square. The destination can be changed to southern Grand Exchange entrance (requires Easy Varrock achievements) or north-east church (requires Elite Varrock achievements).","pic":null},{"text":"A Grand Exchange Teleport, ring of wealth, ring of fortune, or luck of the dwarves can be used to teleport to the Grand Exchange.","pic":null},{"text":"Varrock has four main gates, all of which are open to the public. Each is guarded by several level 36 guards, although they are not aggressive. The north gate can be found near the Wilderness wall and is commonly used by those travelling to Wilderness Crater or exploring the Wilderness. The east gate can be found after following the northern path at the crossroads near northern Al Kharid. The west gate can be reached by travelling east from Gunnarsgrunn. The south gate can be reached by travelling north-west from Lumbridge. Near it is the Stone Circle, where many level 7 and 20 dark wizards can be found.","pic":["locimg/e2df3be5e7f7ee56.webp","Varrock north gate",0,0]},{"text":"Varrock east entrance.png | Varrock east entrance","pic":["locimg/a9aa12a5af1c2b59.webp","Varrock south entrance",0,0]},{"text":"Varrock south entrance.png | Varrock south entrance","pic":null},{"text":"Varrock north entrance.png | Varrock north gate","pic":null},{"text":"There are also several other less-official entrances. By travelling north from the road east of the Gunnarsgrunn, players can enter the Grand Exchange, and from there the Varrock Palace grounds. An Agility shortcut north-west of the Grand Exchange can be used by members with 21 agility, running two-way between Varrock and Edgeville.","pic":null}]}}